></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">The callback will return and carry an “error” object when the asynchronous operation is done. If the operation is done without any errors, the “error” object is<code>null</code>.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>error</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">ErrorImp</span> </code></span></td><td>Error code</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">Methods</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback_onsuccess\" data-target=\"djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback_onsuccess\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>onSuccess</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback_onfailure\" data-target=\"djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback_onfailure\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>onFailure</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      ","buildId":"1795684701585"}